r of in-plane pores and shows a high specific surface area (111.4 m2/g). This not only creates abundant active edge sites but also enhances the mass transfer and increases the accessibility of the active sites. Compared with Ti3C2Tx, in a 0.5 mol/L H2SO4 electrolyte, the porous Ti3C2Tx shows a 1.7 times higher electrochemical surface area (440 mF/cm2), a 95.2% lower charge transfer resistance (12.8 Ω), and a 69.8% lower Tafel slope (144 mV/dec), and thus exhibits a lower overpotential (535.5 mV) with good stability at a current density of 10 mA/cm2. At the same time, the HER performance of porous Ti3C2Tx can be further enhanced by near-infrared laser irradiation based on the localized surface plasmon resonance effect.'}, 'paragraphs': {'ok': True, 'messages': ['摘要内容为单一段落，符合要求'], 'abstract_paragraph': 'Abstract: MXene is an emerging class of two-dimensional (2D) layered transition metal carbides or nitrides. Due to the highly tunable components and surface functional groups, they hold great potential in electrocatalytic hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). However, MXene nanosheets suffer from a strong tendency to restack and a lack of active edge sites. In this work, the porous Ti3C2Tx was synthesized by an oxidation and etching two-step strategy and then characterized by a series of spectroscopic techniques. The obtained porous Ti3C2Tx possesses a large number of in-plane pores and shows a high specific surface area (111.4 m2/g). This not only creates abundant active edge sites but also enhances the mass transfer and increases the accessibility of the active sites. Compared with Ti3C2Tx, in a 0.5 mol/L H2SO4 electrolyte, the porous Ti3C2Tx shows a 1.7 times higher electrochemical surface area (440 mF/cm2), a 95.2% lower charge transfer resistance (12.8 Ω), and a 69.8% lower Tafel slope (144 mV/dec), and thus exhibits a lower overpotential (535.5 mV) with good stability at a current density of 10 mA/cm2. At the same time, the HER performance of porous Ti3C2Tx can be further enhanced by near-infrared laser irradiation based on the localized surface plasmon resonance effect.'}, 'format': {'ok': False, 'messages': ['摘要格式问题：', '  - 行间距应为1.5倍行距（1.5倍），实际为单倍行距（1.0倍）']}, 'summary': ['摘要检查结果: False']}, 'Keywords': {'structure': {'ok': False, 'messages': ['关键词标题格式正确（Keywords: 格式）', '关键词分隔符混用：应统一使用分号分割，不应混用逗号', '关键词数量适中（3个关键词）', '关键词内容长度适中'], 'content': 'porous Ti3C2Tx, hydrogen evolution reaction (HER); active edge site; localized surface plasmon resonance', 'keywords_list': ['porous Ti3C2Tx, hydrogen evolution reaction (HER)', 'active edge site', 'localized surface plasmon resonance']}, 'paragraphs': {'ok': True, 'messages': ['找到关键词段落'], 'keywords_paragraph': 'Keywords:porous Ti3C2Tx, hydrogen evolution reaction (HER); active edge site; localized surface plasmon resonance'}, 'format': {'ok': False, 'messages': ['关键词格式问题：', '  - 字体应为正体，实际为斜体']}, 'clc_structure': {'ok': True, 'messages': ['CLC number和Document code结构正确'], 'clc_content': 'O611', 'document_content': 'A', 'clc_paragraph': 'CLC number: O611            Document code: A'}, 'clc_format': {'ok': True, 'messages': ['CLC number和Document code格式检查通过']}, 'footnote_structure': {'ok': True, 'messages': ['Received date格式正确', 'Foundation item格式正确', 'Correspondence格式正确', 'Citation格式正确', '脚注结构检测通过'], 'footnote_paragraphs': []}, 'footnote_format': {'ok': False, 'messages': ['脚注格式问题：', '  - 脚注字体大小应为小五（9.0pt），实际为五号（11.0pt）']}, 'summary': ['关键词、CLC和脚注检查结果: False']}, 'Content': {'hierarchy': {'ok': False, 'messages': ["发现 4 个疑似标题但完全缺少编号，标题应有编号格式（如 '1 Title', '1.1 Subtitle'）", "  - 段落 15: '1.1 Materials...'", "  - 段落 17: '1.1.1 Materialss...'", "  - 段落 29: '多孔Ti3C2Tx用于高效电催化析氢反应...'", "  - 段落 34: '关键词：多孔Ti3C2Tx；析氢反应；边缘活性位点；局域表面等离子体共振效应...'", '找到Introduction标题（0 Introduction）', '标题编号连续性正确'], 'titles': [{'level': 0, 'number': '0', 'text': 'Introduction', 'paragraph': '0 Introduction', 'paragraph_index': 7, 'full_text': '0 Introduction', 'has_number': True, 'has_auto_numbering': False}, {'level': 1, 'n