eal part of impedance and the imaginary part of impedance of the material at different frequencies are calculated theoretically, and the correctness of the theoretical calculation is verified by experiments. The experimental results show that the calculated values are basically consistent with the measured values, and the feasibility and reliability of this method are also verified. A simple method for calculating the absorption coefficient of sound absorbing materials is presented.'}, 'paragraphs': {'ok': True, 'messages': ['摘要内容为单一段落，符合要求'], 'abstract_paragraph': <docx.text.paragraph.Paragraph object at 0x0000021E357897D0>}, 'format': {'ok': False, 'messages': ['摘要格式问题：', '  - 行间距应为1.5倍行距（1.5倍），实际为单倍行距（1.0倍）']}, 'summary': ['摘要检查结果: False']}, 'Keywords': {'structure': {'ok': True, 'messages': ['关键词标题格式正确（Keywords: 格式）', '关键词分隔符正确（使用分号分割）', '关键词数量适中（3个关键词）', '关键词内容长度适中'], 'content': 'flow resistance; Acoustic impedance; Sound absorption coefficient', 'keywords_list': ['flow resistance', 'Acoustic impedance', 'Sound absorption coefficient']}, 'paragraphs': {'ok': True, 'messages': ['找到关键词段落'], 'keywords_paragraph': <docx.text.paragraph.Paragraph object at 0x0000021E418D0550>}, 'format': {'ok': False, 'messages': ['关键词格式问题：', '  - 字体应为正体，实际为斜体', '  - 行间距应为1.5倍行距（1.5倍），实际为单倍行距（1.0倍）']}, 'clc_structure': {'ok': False, 'messages': ["CLC number和Document code格式错误，应为 'CLC number: xxx    Document code: A' 格式"], 'clc_content': '', 'document_content': '', 'clc_paragraph': None}, 'clc_format': {'ok': False, 'messages': ['无法检测CLC和Document code格式']}, 'footnote_structure': {'ok': False, 'messages': ['Received date格式正确', 'Foundation item格式正确', 'Correspondence格式正确', '脚注中未找到citation项目'], 'footnote_paragraphs': []}, 'footnote_format': {'ok': True, 'messages': ['脚注格式检查通过']}, 'summary': ['关键词、CLC和脚注检查结果: False']}, 'Content': {'hierarchy': {'ok': False, 'messages': ["发现 7 个使用Word自动编号的标题，应改为文本形式的编号（如 '1 Title'，而非使用Word编号库）", "  - 段落 10: 'Calculation method of sound absorption coefficient